{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>&quot;Your job is to write the death certificate.&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/fleming_manor_gif_01.gif?t=1748793044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>'The Death at Fleming Manor'</i></strong><i> is a forensic mystery adventure set in 1959 Britain. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/fleming_manor_gif_02.gif?t=1748793044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Investigate eerie incidents unfolding in a grand country estate and complete realistic documents such as death certificates and emergency medical reports.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/fleming_manor_gif_04.gif?t=1748793044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Blending immersive storytelling with clever puzzles, and presented in a unique 1960s vintage detective comic book style, this game offers the feeling of stepping into a classic mystery novel.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3758950/extras/fleming_manor_gif_03.gif?t=1748793044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>Key Features</i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Realistic forensic document-writing gameplay</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>A mystery set in a lavish 1950s British manor</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Stylized visuals inspired by 1960s vintage detective 